            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The composition is based on one type of power saw (produced in Stihl, Germany) and the transportation distances are partly estimated. This module should not be used if its relative importance would be high in a certain environmental inventory. Service life capacity, declared by producer: 2500 hours;
Synonyms: chain, motor, Kettensäge; 
UUID: acd7e1e7-f33c-3808-ac47-03ecdb0a065c</common:generalComment>
